From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wbemprox, wmic: host values for system classes, root\SecurityCenter2 (3518)

wbemprox, wmic: host values for the system classes, and root\SecurityCenter2

Win32_OperatingSystem gets CreationClassName, CSCreationClassName, Debug, Description (the server comment),
Distributed, FreeSpaceInPagingFiles, SizeStoredInPagingFiles, LargeSystemCache, MaxNumberOfProcesses,
MaxProcessMemorySize, NumberOfProcesses, PortableOperatingSystem; the virtual memory figures are the commit
limit (RAM plus swap) rather than the address space; LastBootUpTime is local time with its UTC offset.
Win32_ComputerSystem gets BootupState, Caption, CreationClassName, CurrentTimeZone, DaylightInEffect,
DNSHostName, EnableDaylightSavingsTime, PartOfDomain, PCSystemType (from the chassis), PrimaryOwnerName,
Status, Workgroup. Win32_Processor: caches, enabled cores, thread count, socket, status, class names, and
CpuStatus 1 for an enabled processor. Win32_BIOS is named by its version string with the system's serial
number (no invented serial or version). Win32_DiskDrive takes model and firmware from the storage
descriptor. Win32_LogicalDisk and Win32_Volume report the volume's real size, free space, label, file system
flags and boot volume. New root\SecurityCenter2 with AntiVirusProduct, AntiSpywareProduct (SG Defender, from
its status.json: 266240 on, 266256 old definitions, 262144 off) and FirewallProduct (SG Firewall, from the
firewall policy). wmic prints unsigned 32 bit properties unsigned.
